  Text: "\"Yes, a four-legged cheerleader, that's what it was!\nIt could have also
    been a mantis, or a skinny crab wearing boxing gloves... Are you sure I didn\u2019t
    mention the four legs part?\"\n\nGuess he forgot that crucial detail at our delicate
    moment of need, but what's done is done."
